WEBVTT

00:10:29.416 --> 00:10:32.169
that giving and receiving

00:10:34.004 --> 00:10:38.133
connects people, beliefs and action.

00:10:38.467 --> 00:10:41.220
It is not all about the money,

00:10:41.261 --> 00:10:45.474
and those who have resources
don't have all the power.

00:10:45.516 --> 00:10:47.601
They shouldn't have all the power.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:51.063
Giving and receiving
from the Earth endowments

00:10:51.105 --> 00:10:56.151
is also part of a virtuous
healing principle.

00:10:56.193 --> 00:10:57.403
In this way,

00:10:57.444 --> 00:11:02.533
even the "poorest" Indigenous community
can give back to all of us.